WEBVTT

01:31.091 --> 01:33.856
[Episode 10]

02:00.319 --> 02:02.319
That was beautiful!

02:02.319 --> 02:04.680
Miss, you missed a note, the seventh one.

02:05.560 --> 02:08.800
A light stroke, not a pluck.

02:08.800 --> 02:12.599
You have an excellent ear
to notice such a subtle difference.

02:12.599 --> 02:15.199
Would you play another piece?

02:15.199 --> 02:16.599
Another piece!

02:16.599 --> 02:18.360
Another piece, please!

02:18.360 --> 02:19.680
Another piece!

02:33.759 --> 02:37.520
Ms. Yan, you can enjoy the music
and admire the moon here.

02:38.800 --> 02:41.360
Ms. Yan, music is like medicine.

02:41.360 --> 02:44.319
The five notes, Gong, Shang, Jue, Zhi,
and Yu, harmonize together.

02:44.319 --> 02:46.120
They can heal the qi
of the five internal organs.

02:46.120 --> 02:48.039
When the music ends, the illness fades.

02:48.039 --> 02:50.680
When you visit next time,
I will personally play the qin for you

02:50.680 --> 02:52.800
and guide you through the five-note healing.

02:53.879 --> 02:58.599
Alright. When I have the chance,
I will certainly come to experience it.

02:58.599 --> 03:02.560
This is our Huiyin House's
exclusive orange blossom fragrance.

03:02.560 --> 03:05.240
It calms the mind and helps you sleep.
Here, smell it.

03:08.319 --> 03:10.759
This is the same scent
as the musician Si Qi wears.

03:10.759 --> 03:12.000
Then I must have it even more.

03:12.000 --> 03:13.088
Very well.

03:14.120 --> 03:16.639
Ms. Yan, this is Huiyin House's
exclusive beauty balm.

03:17.856 --> 03:18.919
This is Huiyin House's exclusive--

03:18.919 --> 03:19.968
I'll take them all.

03:21.719 --> 03:23.120
As expected of the capital.

03:23.120 --> 03:27.439
Even listening to music has so many nuances.
Truly an eye-opener.

03:36.639 --> 03:38.960
Gentlemen, please have these
delivered to Bofeng House for me.

03:38.960 --> 03:39.968
Yes.

03:43.879 --> 03:47.719
Mr. Shen, you really are a free spirit,
so carefree and unrestrained.

03:47.719 --> 03:50.280
- Who is she?
- You taught girls to play dice in Shazhou

03:50.280 --> 03:51.919
and drank with noble ladies in the capital.

03:51.919 --> 03:53.919
And now you're at Huiyin House,
charming all the ladies.

03:53.919 --> 03:56.800
You're truly adored by all,
always surrounded by admirers.

03:57.984 --> 03:59.159
Who is she?

03:59.159 --> 04:02.400
Ms. Yan, you remember so clearly.
Could it be you care about me?

04:03.560 --> 04:04.704
You lecher!

04:10.439 --> 04:12.960
Ms. Yan, you change your face
faster than you turn a page.

04:12.960 --> 04:15.919
You just got the restaurant yesterday,
and now you act like we're strangers.

04:15.919 --> 04:17.959
You're quite blessed with romantic luck too.

04:17.959 --> 04:20.480
Today, you're charming everyone
left and right.

04:21.240 --> 04:24.120
I came here to learn from them
for Bofeng House's opening.

04:24.120 --> 04:27.160
I'm not like you, fluttering around
like a butterfly wherever you go.

04:27.160 --> 04:29.519
Afraid others might not know
you're such a flirt?

04:29.519 --> 04:30.600
Takes one to know one.

04:31.240 --> 04:33.800
I have business to attend to today.
We'll talk another time.

04:33.800 --> 04:35.800
Business?
What business could you possibly have?

04:38.319 --> 04:39.759
I checked Situ Xue's household registration.

04:39.759 --> 04:41.480
She comes from a common background.

04:41.480 --> 04:45.040
She made her name at the Flower Festival
and bought Huiyin House later.

04:45.040 --> 04:46.879
Since then, she has been running it lawfully.

04:46.879 --> 04:49.079
Huiyin House is frequented
by high officials and nobles.

04:49.079 --> 04:50.879
Now, the Xiyan flower has appeared again.

04:50.879 --> 04:53.079
Whether it's coincidence or design
remains to be seen.

04:54.040 --> 04:55.360
And that crossbow bolt.

04:55.360 --> 04:59.319
Whether it's connected
to Beijian or Zhongwan is hard to tell.

04:59.319 --> 05:02.959
Keep an eye on Huiyin House
and get on good terms with Situ Xue.

05:02.959 --> 05:03.968
Understood.

05:13.760 --> 05:16.608
[Blood Moon Society]

05:36.500 --> 05:40.288
[Mr. Shangguan, Blood Moon Society]

05:40.288 --> 05:44.279
[Blood Moon Society]
Black Bird eternal. Blood Moon forever.

05:44.279 --> 05:46.279
Welcome, Mr. Shangguan.

05:50.519 --> 05:53.319
An uninvited guest
went to Huiyin House today.

05:53.319 --> 05:56.399
[Situ Xue, Blood Moon Society]
You see all. He came for the Xiyan flower.

05:57.199 --> 05:59.759
That dog emperor found a clue at Heihu Crew.

05:59.759 --> 06:02.519
Now, the Ning Empire
tightly monitors all military camps.

06:02.519 --> 06:05.519
[Mo Yu Han, Blood Moon Society]
We must find another source for our weapons.

06:06.120 --> 06:08.199
I've already had men locate a private mine.

06:08.800 --> 06:12.639
From now on, keep men on site day and night
to forge weapons.

06:12.639 --> 06:16.399
So we can restore our kingdom sooner.

06:16.399 --> 06:18.680
But Ying Gua
has already grown suspicious of us.

06:18.680 --> 06:20.399
Should we strike first and kill him?

06:20.399 --> 06:23.519
Acting rashly now would only alert him.

06:23.519 --> 06:26.360
What I want is a single, fatal strike.

06:26.360 --> 06:28.560
Master, I have also learned

06:28.560 --> 06:31.680
that Ying Gua has newly established
the Censorate in the Ning court

06:31.680 --> 06:34.040
to strip the two chancellors of their power.

06:34.040 --> 06:37.279
And he had the new female Zhuangyuan,
Meng Ting Hui, lead the Censorate.

06:44.000 --> 06:47.879
The more chaotic the Ning court becomes,
the better for us.

06:48.720 --> 06:52.160
Get close to Meng Ting Hui.
She must be brought to our side.

06:54.040 --> 06:55.136
As you command.

07:05.759 --> 07:08.959
Destroy the Ning Empire! Restore Zhongwan!

07:08.959 --> 07:12.040
Destroy the Ning Empire! Restore Zhongwan!

07:12.040 --> 07:15.199
Destroy the Ning Empire! Restore Zhongwan!

07:15.199 --> 07:18.040
[Blood Moon Society]
Destroy the Ning Empire! Restore Zhongwan!

07:33.600 --> 07:36.736
Miss Meng, I've been prepared.
I'm not afraid of ghosts.

07:37.519 --> 07:40.360
I'm not afraid of those. Protect Miss Shen.

07:41.959 --> 07:43.040
I'm not afraid either.

07:43.720 --> 07:48.639
Miss Shen, a delicate woman like you
should just stay at home.

07:49.560 --> 07:52.040
If Miss Meng can do it, so can I.

07:52.040 --> 07:53.216
I'll give it to you for free.

08:03.519 --> 08:05.632
Miss Meng, this is the place.

08:06.800 --> 08:09.240
[Ransom Corpses for a Hundred Taels]
Those corpse thieves have been rampaging.

08:09.240 --> 08:11.040
They dig up the villagers' ancestral graves.

08:11.720 --> 08:14.160
We must pay to redeem our family's bodies.

08:14.160 --> 08:18.040
And every year, we pay over a hundred taels
just to keep a burial place.

08:18.040 --> 08:21.240
The slightest complaint, and they beat us.

08:21.240 --> 08:26.439
After my grandfather's body was stolen,
my grandmother died of grief and rage.

08:26.439 --> 08:27.879
This is outrageous.

08:27.879 --> 08:31.079
I can't believe such atrocities exist
right under His Majesty's watch.

08:31.079 --> 08:34.120
We reported it repeatedly.
The Ministry of Justice ignored us.

08:34.120 --> 08:35.919
They fobbed us off with various excuses.

08:35.919 --> 08:38.720
They said it was just a missing corpse,
nothing more.

08:38.720 --> 08:40.120
They are all in cahoots.

08:41.000 --> 08:44.519
Where are those corpse thieves?
I must meet them personally.

08:45.120 --> 08:47.679
They only show up
when stealing corpses and extorting money.

08:48.919 --> 08:50.840
Then we'll wait for them
to walk right into the trap.

08:54.919 --> 08:57.240
Second Master,
your calculations are truly divine.

08:58.000 --> 09:00.000
You knew they would
secretly bury the corpses.

09:00.000 --> 09:01.759
As expected, we found them.

09:01.759 --> 09:03.279
A bunch of reckless fools.

09:04.360 --> 09:06.112
We're charging them
tenfold this time. Hear me?

09:07.104 --> 09:08.679
My brother is too soft-hearted.

09:09.399 --> 09:12.440
Once I'm done with this,
I'll go to Master for my reward.

09:13.120 --> 09:15.320
Master will surely let me
take over the gang's business again.

09:21.080 --> 09:23.279
You go check
if there are any fresh graves over there.

09:23.279 --> 09:24.384
Yes, Second Master.

09:28.679 --> 09:29.696
- Seize them!
- Don't move!

09:33.399 --> 09:35.559
The Divine Guard is here. Who dares to move?

09:47.480 --> 09:48.640
Put them down.

09:50.399 --> 09:53.919
Lv Er of the Huxiao Gang.
It's been a long time.

09:55.879 --> 09:58.480
Lv Er? Who's that?

09:59.120 --> 10:02.080
I'm just a petty grave robber, nothing more.

10:09.840 --> 10:13.279
Meng Ting Hui, as a court official,
how dare you use private punishment?

10:13.279 --> 10:14.440
Is there no law left?

10:14.440 --> 10:15.919
So you remember me.

10:15.919 --> 10:19.600
Private punishment? The law?
You're in no position to talk.

10:20.960 --> 10:24.371
If I weren't keeping you alive
to track down the Huxiao Gang,

10:24.371 --> 10:26.356
I'd cut you into a thousand pieces.

10:29.200 --> 10:32.519
Miss Meng, the law requires
conclusive evidence before a conviction.

10:35.679 --> 10:36.832
Take him back to the Censorate.

10:37.679 --> 10:41.000
There are plenty of tools there.
We can catch up slowly.

10:41.000 --> 10:42.679
- Take him away.
- Yes.

10:42.679 --> 10:43.776
Move!

11:01.480 --> 11:05.279
By order of Minister Wan of Justice,
we came to arrest the corpse thieves.

11:05.279 --> 11:08.360
Miss Meng, the Ministry of Justice
will take over the prisoners.

11:08.360 --> 11:10.600
You were nowhere to be seen.

11:10.600 --> 11:13.759
Now that we've made the arrest,
you smell blood and show up.

11:13.759 --> 11:18.480
The Capital Prefecture Office
has passed the case to us for investigation.

11:18.480 --> 11:19.799
What if I refuse to hand them over?

11:19.799 --> 11:21.799
We're here on orders to take the prisoners.

11:21.799 --> 11:24.879
If you obstruct us,
don't blame us for being rude.

11:26.240 --> 11:27.360
[Censorate]
Captain Di.

11:28.960 --> 11:30.399
Obstructing the Ministry of Justice?

11:30.399 --> 11:33.399
I can have all of you arrested right now.

11:33.399 --> 11:34.496
Get them!

11:37.683 --> 11:39.279
[Censorate]

11:39.279 --> 11:43.039
Miss Meng, I truly do not wish
to cross swords with a colleague.

11:43.039 --> 11:45.120
If you insist on obstructing law enforcement,

11:45.840 --> 11:50.200
Minister Wan's impeachment will be presented
before His Majesty tomorrow.

11:50.200 --> 11:53.720
The Censorate has His Majesty's leave
to report directly.

11:54.360 --> 11:55.679
Let's see

11:55.679 --> 11:59.480
whose memorial reaches His Majesty first,
yours or mine.

11:59.480 --> 12:01.600
All criminal matters fall under our ministry.

12:02.360 --> 12:05.440
Surely even His Majesty
would not bypass due process.

12:06.120 --> 12:08.559
These prisoners are ours today,
like it or not.

12:08.559 --> 12:10.720
Don't force our hand, Miss Meng.

12:10.720 --> 12:16.159
When Minister Wan arrives,
he won't be as lenient as I am.

12:16.159 --> 12:18.480
Miss Meng, by the Laws of Ning Empire,

12:18.480 --> 12:21.559
when it involves major cases
or important suspects,

12:21.559 --> 12:24.720
it must go through the Ministry of Justice
to His Majesty for final judgment.

12:24.720 --> 12:27.720
It's the court's established process.
Please think twice.

12:27.720 --> 12:31.000
Miss Meng, His Majesty established
the Censorate under great pressure.

12:31.639 --> 12:34.879
It's newly founded.
Don't cross the Ministry of Justice yet.

12:34.879 --> 12:37.039
Miss Meng, we just set up the ambush.

12:37.679 --> 12:39.639
Yet they rushed over
in the middle of the night.

12:40.279 --> 12:42.240
Something is fishy about this.

12:42.240 --> 12:45.919
Let's play the long game.
I'll watch them from inside their ministry.

12:50.720 --> 12:55.279
Fine. I will take a step back today.

12:55.279 --> 12:59.120
However, I will report this
to His Majesty truthfully.

12:59.120 --> 13:00.600
Thank you for your cooperation, Miss Meng.

13:01.960 --> 13:03.008
Take them away.

13:11.559 --> 13:13.960
What's with that expression?
Are you provoking Miss Meng?

13:45.268 --> 13:47.136
[Release the prisoners]

13:59.764 --> 14:01.312
[Release the prisoners]

14:09.639 --> 14:12.799
Miss Meng, following your instructions,

14:12.799 --> 14:16.639
we've recorded all the evil deeds
those villains committed in the village.

14:16.639 --> 14:18.356
[Grocery owner Chen Liu,
for late payment of protection money...]

14:21.683 --> 14:23.159
[Corpse thieves murdered
three in my son's family]

14:23.159 --> 14:26.080
These are anonymous letters
written in blood by the villagers.

14:26.080 --> 14:27.399
They secretly slipped them to me.

14:32.672 --> 14:33.888
[The corpse thieves seized my land and home]

14:35.399 --> 14:37.679
Besides digging up graves,
stealing corpses, and extorting money,

14:39.120 --> 14:41.720
they also dragged people
to death with horses.

14:41.720 --> 14:44.080
The crimes of the Huxiao Gang
are too numerous to record.

14:44.080 --> 14:47.519
Villagers have reported before.
And the Ministry of Justice took those too.

14:47.519 --> 14:50.960
But they were only locked up
for three days before being released.

14:50.960 --> 14:52.279
They became even more arrogant.

14:53.159 --> 14:56.519
They burned the villagers
who reported them to death.

14:57.440 --> 15:01.799
With that, I'm afraid
we're also in great danger.

15:03.000 --> 15:05.639
The Minister of Justice, Wan Kai,
is Lord Xu's man.

15:05.639 --> 15:08.080
If the Huxiao Gang has such free rein
at the Ministry of Justice,

15:08.080 --> 15:09.639
this goes much deeper than we thought.

15:09.639 --> 15:11.480
I'll take this to His Majesty myself now.

15:13.519 --> 15:15.919
Please, Miss Meng, you must save us.

15:15.919 --> 15:17.399
Thank you, Miss Meng.

15:17.399 --> 15:18.639
- Please rise.
- Thank you, Miss Meng.

15:18.639 --> 15:19.759
- Get up first.
- Get up.

15:26.679 --> 15:29.120
Yin Qing signaled.
Let's go to the Ministry of Justice now.

15:29.120 --> 15:31.840
Zhi Li, you go mobilize the Divine Guard.

15:31.840 --> 15:33.159
This time, I won't let him off again.

15:41.920 --> 15:44.039
[Severe Punishment]

15:44.039 --> 15:46.279
Miss Meng, they really were released.

15:49.279 --> 15:52.840
Miss Meng, what an honor.
You personally came to receive us.

15:52.840 --> 15:57.759
But no need. We've had our fill
of good wine and meat in prison.

15:57.759 --> 15:59.799
If you find the Ministry of Justice
too comfortable,

16:00.679 --> 16:02.720
then come try the Censorate's prison.

16:06.600 --> 16:09.440
You little wench,
you really think you're something?

16:15.519 --> 16:16.559
Do you still dare to report?

16:16.559 --> 16:19.240
Right under His Majesty's watch,
you dare to treat the law as nothing?

16:21.240 --> 16:22.960
Stop! Stop it!

16:24.279 --> 16:25.344
Stop!

16:26.320 --> 16:27.456
We won't report anymore!

16:29.000 --> 16:31.399
- Your little face is quite pretty.
- Let go!

16:31.399 --> 16:34.039
It's a pity your heart is venomous.

16:34.039 --> 16:37.399
You put me in prison for three days.
Time to make it up to me.

16:42.720 --> 16:44.080
You beast!

16:44.080 --> 16:46.759
Cheng, we won't report anymore.

16:46.759 --> 16:47.879
We won't report anymore.

16:48.879 --> 16:50.320
- Get off!
- Cheng!

16:50.960 --> 16:52.639
I didn't get a good look earlier.

16:53.600 --> 16:57.480
Looking closely today,
your little face really is quite beautiful.

16:57.480 --> 16:59.039
What a waste to be an official.

16:59.039 --> 17:01.480
Why don't you be my woman?

17:03.840 --> 17:05.519
Miss Meng, you smell so good.

17:09.759 --> 17:11.559
Cheng! Cheng!

17:13.119 --> 17:16.559
Lv Er, today we'll settle all scores,
old and new.

17:17.359 --> 17:21.279
You wench, don't think being an official
means I dare not touch you.

17:21.279 --> 17:22.400
Beat them to death!

17:22.400 --> 17:23.559
Don't you dare move!

17:23.559 --> 17:24.608
Stop!

17:26.160 --> 17:27.232
Miss Meng.

17:29.079 --> 17:33.088
Lv Er, today you'll beg for death,
and I won't grant it.

17:33.088 --> 17:34.319
[Censorate]

17:34.319 --> 17:36.720
Divine Guard, on my order, arrest them!

17:36.720 --> 17:38.016
- Yes!
- Get them!

17:48.559 --> 17:51.440
Meng Ting Hui, touch a single hair on me,

17:52.119 --> 17:54.400
and our master will ensure you beg for death.

17:56.000 --> 17:57.440
I'm counting on him to show.

17:57.440 --> 18:00.079
I'd like to see
who is backing you from behind,

18:00.079 --> 18:02.400
allowing you to act so recklessly.

18:02.400 --> 18:05.472
His backer is not someone you want to cross.

18:06.079 --> 18:07.599
Just wait till he comes for you.

18:08.279 --> 18:10.079
Today, I will make you see

18:10.799 --> 18:13.759
how the laws of the Ning Empire
deal with criminals.

18:14.599 --> 18:15.648
Execute now!

18:18.359 --> 18:20.200
Good! Good!

18:20.200 --> 18:21.952
Excellent! Beat him!

18:26.319 --> 18:28.640
Meng Ting Hui, you wench!

18:33.559 --> 18:36.720
Good!

18:37.759 --> 18:42.680
She's got more grit
than any of those bureaucratic windbags.

18:42.680 --> 18:44.640
These beasts have harmed so many people.

18:45.279 --> 18:46.519
They finally get what they deserve.

18:47.279 --> 18:48.319
Yes! Beat him to death!

18:48.319 --> 18:50.200
Beat him to death! Beat him to death!

18:50.200 --> 18:51.200
Let him go!

18:54.480 --> 18:58.440
Take a good look
at how miserable Lv Er's end is.

18:58.440 --> 19:01.000
Go back and tell your master
every single detail.

19:01.000 --> 19:03.440
I, Meng Ting Hui, will be waiting
for him at the Censorate.

19:03.440 --> 19:08.599
While I'm at the Censorate,
I'll uproot every last one of Huxiao Gang.

19:08.599 --> 19:09.664
Beat him to death!

19:10.680 --> 19:12.319
I-I will deliver the message.

19:12.319 --> 19:13.344
Stop!

19:15.960 --> 19:20.519
Meng Ting Hui, you're making such a big fuss
over a few petty thieves.

19:20.519 --> 19:21.720
What are you trying to do?

19:21.720 --> 19:22.799
Continue the beating.

19:22.799 --> 19:23.808
How dare you!

19:24.680 --> 19:28.759
Meng Ting Hui, how dare you cane commoners
in the street right in front of me?

19:28.759 --> 19:30.519
They count as commoners?

19:30.519 --> 19:32.680
Brutal and wicked, they had it coming.

19:32.680 --> 19:34.279
And behind them is the Huxiao Gang.

19:34.279 --> 19:36.640
If I let them go today,
there will be endless trouble later.

19:36.640 --> 19:37.799
Help!

19:37.799 --> 19:42.519
As the Minister of Justice,
you disregard the people's grievances.

19:42.519 --> 19:44.920
And you've blocked me
from justice more than once.

19:44.920 --> 19:46.920
What exactly are your intentions?

19:46.920 --> 19:50.720
Miss Meng, you are merely
a minor official of the sixth rank.

19:50.720 --> 19:52.400
Quite the display of authority.

19:52.400 --> 19:56.839
They only stole corpses and looted graves.
No need for a public beating.

19:56.839 --> 19:59.599
I must submit an impeachment
against you today.

19:59.599 --> 20:02.960
If you have a clear conscience,
go right ahead.

20:02.960 --> 20:08.319
Meng Ting Hui, Master will surely avenge me.

20:08.319 --> 20:11.279
Let him come.
He's exactly who I'm waiting for.

20:20.200 --> 20:21.599
Miss Meng, he has fainted.

20:27.200 --> 20:28.680
Miss Meng, well done!

20:28.680 --> 20:30.480
Yes, Miss Meng is a true righteous official!

20:30.480 --> 20:33.359
- Yin Qing, have horses drag the survivors.
- Miss Meng is a righteous official!

20:33.359 --> 20:37.160
Meng Ting Hui,
your methods are utterly ruthless.

20:37.160 --> 20:39.319
I'm taking this to His Majesty, and you'll--

20:39.319 --> 20:42.359
Suit yourself. I am merely repaying them

20:43.359 --> 20:44.920
in their own coin.

20:59.584 --> 21:02.624
[Shen Mansion]

21:06.880 --> 21:09.880
Mother, try Fangzhuan House's breakfast.
Fresh out of the kitchen.

21:15.359 --> 21:16.880
You do have a good appetite.

21:17.920 --> 21:19.960
Meng Ting Hui caned the corpse thieves
to death in public.

21:19.960 --> 21:21.359
This matter has shaken the entire court.

21:22.640 --> 21:25.519
As His Majesty's close minister,
won't you take a look?

21:25.519 --> 21:28.359
Father, a man's got to eat.

21:28.359 --> 21:29.799
I work better on a full stomach.

21:30.400 --> 21:33.000
Besides, His Majesty is currently in a rage.

21:33.000 --> 21:34.359
I wouldn't dare to cross him.

21:35.799 --> 21:37.200
By the way, I heard them say

21:37.839 --> 21:41.079
the memorials against Meng Ting Hui
are piled higher than a man,

21:41.799 --> 21:44.119
all begging His Majesty
to severely punish her.

21:44.119 --> 21:45.799
She's stirred up quite a storm this time.

21:45.799 --> 21:47.720
I can't even imagine
how angry His Majesty must be.

21:47.720 --> 21:50.000
The Censorate is always under siege.

21:50.000 --> 21:53.319
Meng Ting Hui's approach
is unlike those stiff, rule-bound officials.

21:53.319 --> 21:54.720
Conflict is inevitable.

21:55.359 --> 21:58.119
As for the future direction of the Censorate
that His Majesty envisions,

21:58.799 --> 22:01.160
it all depends on the contest
between the two sides.

22:05.880 --> 22:09.000
You two really aren't worried at all?

22:09.000 --> 22:11.079
This matter now even involves Zhi Li.

22:11.079 --> 22:13.000
Hearing His Majesty went to the Censorate,

22:13.000 --> 22:15.200
she rushed over
without even eating breakfast.

22:15.200 --> 22:17.079
Nian is just too indulgent with Zhi Li.

22:17.759 --> 22:20.119
She even went to the cemetery at midnight.

22:20.119 --> 22:21.720
She's getting bolder and bolder.

22:21.720 --> 22:24.799
Father, now do you see
how well-behaved I am compared to her?

22:24.799 --> 22:26.440
Nian at least knows to protect her.

22:26.440 --> 22:28.799
As her own brother,
you are completely indifferent.

22:29.720 --> 22:31.559
All you know is to sit here and eat.

22:31.559 --> 22:35.079
It's Zhi Li who doesn't follow the rules,
not me.

22:35.960 --> 22:39.240
Forget it. Zhi Li has never known hardship.

22:39.240 --> 22:41.240
After this incident, maybe she'll come home.

22:41.240 --> 22:43.240
Then you clearly don't know your sister.

22:43.240 --> 22:45.400
Don't be fooled by her gentle appearance.

22:45.400 --> 22:47.759
Deep down,
she's never been one for the boudoir.

22:47.759 --> 22:50.039
She's stubborn and won't bow to convention.

22:50.640 --> 22:52.000
Just look at Nian.

22:52.000 --> 22:53.799
He came to live with us at the age of ten.

22:53.799 --> 22:56.720
Now, look at how mature and steady
he is in his conduct.

22:56.720 --> 22:59.559
Not only is he considerate
of me and your mother in everything,

22:59.559 --> 23:01.039
but he is attentive to your sister.

23:01.039 --> 23:02.759
And you? Still eating.

23:03.400 --> 23:04.960
How did it become my fault again?

23:04.960 --> 23:06.880
You win. I'll just take my leave.

23:06.880 --> 23:07.904
I'm leaving, Mother.

23:11.839 --> 23:12.928
No waste.

23:12.928 --> 23:14.048
I'm leaving, Father.

23:15.920 --> 23:20.240
A storm is brewing.
Things are about to change.

23:34.079 --> 23:35.168
Zhi Li.

23:35.839 --> 23:37.696
Nian, what brings you here?

23:37.696 --> 23:38.759
I was worried about you.

23:38.759 --> 23:42.640
And it was my Divine Guard
who carried out the caning.

23:45.359 --> 23:47.119
His Majesty is seeing Miss Meng alone.

23:47.119 --> 23:50.279
No one else is allowed to disturb them.

23:50.279 --> 23:52.720
Imperial Guard Huang,
it's been an incense stick's time.

23:52.720 --> 23:54.359
I am truly worried about Miss Meng.

24:02.720 --> 24:05.696
[Pan Wen Hai, Vice Minister of Works]

24:13.319 --> 24:17.640
One died from severe injuries,
and two fainted on the spot.

24:18.920 --> 24:21.359
You have caused a monumental disaster.

24:25.559 --> 24:27.839
Meng Ting Hui, who gave you the nerve?

24:31.359 --> 24:34.279
Look. In just one day,

24:34.279 --> 24:36.359
every memorial in this pile is against you!

24:51.411 --> 24:52.864
[I impeach Meng Ting Hui for caning
a commoner to death in the street]

25:10.419 --> 25:13.400
[The corpse thieves stole my father's coffin
and murdered my wife and children]

25:13.400 --> 25:15.640
Why does Your Majesty
hear only the court officials

25:17.440 --> 25:18.960
instead of the people's grievances?

25:20.000 --> 25:22.519
Lv Er and his men
coerced the Prefect of the Capital earlier

25:22.519 --> 25:23.920
and nearly killed me.

25:25.119 --> 25:26.359
They stole corpses and extorted money.

25:27.279 --> 25:30.400
They even beat Cheng right in front of me

25:30.400 --> 25:32.160
and assaulted his wife in public.

25:32.160 --> 25:34.480
Those beasts preyed on the people,

25:34.480 --> 25:36.400
abused the weak, and stopped at nothing.

25:37.759 --> 25:39.319
Did they not deserve to die?

25:39.319 --> 25:41.600
The law decides who lives and who dies.

25:42.480 --> 25:43.559
The law is dead.

25:44.799 --> 25:48.160
But if the enforcers
cannot tell good from evil, right from wrong,

25:48.160 --> 25:51.400
the law is but a scrap of paper.
What justice is left?

25:52.400 --> 25:55.880
Meng Ting Hui, did you think
that by killing a few lackeys,

25:55.880 --> 25:57.400
you could save the people from their misery?

25:58.680 --> 26:01.960
Then do you know
where the Huxiao Gang's lair is?

26:01.960 --> 26:04.599
How many of the six ministries
has their influence infiltrated?

26:04.599 --> 26:06.200
And who is backing them from behind?

26:07.119 --> 26:11.200
If we cannot uproot them completely,
even more people will suffer.

26:12.559 --> 26:13.799
Saving a thousand is justice.

26:15.279 --> 26:18.200
Is saving one not justice as well?

26:19.119 --> 26:20.880
I do not have Your Majesty's foresight.

26:22.119 --> 26:24.359
I crawled out from a pile of corpses.

26:25.839 --> 26:30.400
Raised among the lowborn,
I've seen how cheap a life can be.

26:31.119 --> 26:34.720
Face to face with evil,
life can be very fleeting.

26:35.440 --> 26:37.599
If I had not made a decisive move yesterday,

26:37.599 --> 26:41.319
Cheng and his wife
would now be two corpses in a mass grave.

26:42.611 --> 26:44.224
If Your Majesty had seen

26:44.224 --> 26:47.079
the people pinned in blood,
torn and shamed by those brutes,

26:48.160 --> 26:49.759
you would not have stood idle.

26:51.160 --> 26:55.759
Does Your Majesty not wish
to gut those vermin with your own hands?

27:07.759 --> 27:09.759
Do you claim to have no private motive?

27:09.759 --> 27:13.519
You abuse your power.
Do you treat my trust as a game?

27:16.240 --> 27:17.559
You have greatly disappointed me.

27:19.720 --> 27:23.920
Your Majesty, isn't the Censorate meant
to punish evil and eradicate villains?

27:23.920 --> 27:27.119
Why does Your Majesty
claim the law's shield for those butchers?

27:27.839 --> 27:29.359
The law is for the people.

27:30.000 --> 27:32.839
Before I became an official,
I was one of those people.

27:32.839 --> 27:34.880
The law should shield the weak,

27:35.599 --> 27:37.720
not shield the guilty from their fate.

27:38.440 --> 27:44.359
Is the Censorate merely a facade
to show Your Majesty as a sage-like ruler?

27:50.359 --> 27:52.224
Miss Meng has gone mad.

27:52.224 --> 27:53.459
This is utterly treasonous!

27:54.160 --> 27:55.759
Such disrespect to His Majesty is unheard of.

28:00.400 --> 28:04.880
You trade on my favor
to run wild and never repent.

28:07.720 --> 28:12.200
Then I must ask you,
what do you take me and the Censorate for?

28:13.039 --> 28:16.079
Your chess pieces
to be manipulated at your will?

28:17.640 --> 28:18.656
Favor?

28:22.160 --> 28:26.599
Isn't the relationship between
Your Majesty and me one of mutual use?

28:27.319 --> 28:32.160
Your Majesty holds the sword
yet cannot find one that fits your hand.

28:32.160 --> 28:33.799
So you settle for the next best thing,

28:34.839 --> 28:38.400
me, a blunt knife
that barely passes as a blade.

28:39.160 --> 28:41.720
If Your Majesty's favor
means letting evil men run free,

28:42.559 --> 28:46.519
making the law a laughingstock,
and leaving the people with grievances,

28:46.519 --> 28:51.799
then I do not care for such favor.

28:53.240 --> 28:57.363
I'd rather be a broken blade,
seeking only a clear conscience.

28:57.363 --> 28:58.656
A clear conscience?

29:00.240 --> 29:05.079
Do you know that in this court,
those with a clear conscience die first?

29:05.079 --> 29:06.480
Then I shall be the first.

29:08.440 --> 29:12.759
I'm unworthy of the Director post,
and I will not keep it.

29:21.039 --> 29:23.359
Your Majesty, although Miss Meng has erred,

29:23.359 --> 29:26.759
she punished the evil corpse thieves
and made a name for the Censorate.

29:26.759 --> 29:29.839
Today, many commoners
have come forward to submit their grievances.

29:29.839 --> 29:32.680
Dismissing Miss Meng at this time
would be unwise.

29:32.680 --> 29:36.896
I have not demanded your account.
And you plead for hers already?

29:37.920 --> 29:41.680
She acts rashly and impulsively.
Shouldn't you have reined her in?

29:43.119 --> 29:44.279
I acknowledge my fault.

29:44.279 --> 29:47.960
Your Majesty, the Divine Guard failed
to stop Miss Meng in time.

29:47.960 --> 29:51.599
I bear a share of the blame.
It cannot fall on Miss Shen alone.

29:51.599 --> 29:55.039
Your Majesty, Miss Meng misspoke
in the heat of the moment.

29:55.039 --> 29:58.400
She meant no offense, Your Majesty.
I beg you to calm your anger.

30:04.480 --> 30:08.480
And who are you to interrupt here?

30:08.480 --> 30:11.720
Indeed, he's no good.
He poisoned me as soon as I arrived.

30:11.720 --> 30:13.440
Yin Qing is my colleague in the Censorate.

30:14.240 --> 30:16.839
Is your Censorate
a place to recruit pretty boys?

30:16.839 --> 30:20.480
Your Majesty's words
are a great insult to me.

30:20.480 --> 30:22.240
Yin Qing is the Censorate's eyes and ears.

30:22.880 --> 30:25.319
He contributed greatly
to capturing the corpse thieves.

30:26.400 --> 30:29.960
If Your Majesty is displeased with me,
punish me alone.

30:30.599 --> 30:31.799
No need to rage at everyone.

30:33.960 --> 30:37.160
From this moment on,
Meng Ting Hui is to move out of here.

31:11.079 --> 31:14.240
Miss Meng, His Majesty is in a rage.

31:15.400 --> 31:16.640
Why not pull back for now?

31:17.400 --> 31:19.759
Wait until His Majesty calms down,
then make plans.

31:21.000 --> 31:22.048
His Majesty's verbal decree:

31:23.559 --> 31:26.200
Meng Ting Hui acted impulsively
and showed disrespect to His Majesty.

31:26.960 --> 31:29.599
She stays in the Ministry of Justice's prison
until further notice.

31:29.599 --> 31:31.960
Although Miss Meng made mistakes,
she did it for the people.

31:31.960 --> 31:33.200
I beg His Majesty to think thrice.

31:33.200 --> 31:36.119
His Majesty's decree stands.
We are merely following orders.

31:37.599 --> 31:39.000
Miss Meng, please cooperate.

31:39.000 --> 31:40.000
But--

31:40.000 --> 31:41.319
No need for more words.

31:42.920 --> 31:44.000
I will go with you.

32:24.119 --> 32:28.440
I have long said that women are unfit
for great responsibilities.

32:29.720 --> 32:36.079
Look, just a few days in office,
and she has already caused such trouble.

32:36.079 --> 32:38.839
His Majesty always complains
that you're meddling.

32:38.839 --> 32:42.480
But as soon as you let go,
such a huge mess occurred.

32:42.480 --> 32:45.119
Lord Xu, you indeed have keen insight.

32:45.119 --> 32:48.599
Since when has the wind in our capital
been steered by a woman?

32:48.599 --> 32:50.759
A mere Meng Ting Hui is nothing to fear.

32:50.759 --> 32:53.079
This woman is full of schemes.

32:53.960 --> 32:57.960
If she stays in the capital,
she'll eventually become a menace.

32:57.960 --> 33:01.640
We must seize the chance
to drive her out of the capital.

33:02.720 --> 33:04.759
The farther away from His Majesty,
the better.

33:06.000 --> 33:07.319
I understand.

33:13.984 --> 33:15.119
Is it tasty?

33:15.119 --> 33:17.160
Yes, thank you, sir.

33:20.160 --> 33:21.344
Master.

33:24.799 --> 33:26.200
Come on, Yang Yang, Bo.

33:26.200 --> 33:28.079
Take the younger ones upstairs to eat.

33:28.079 --> 33:29.088
Alright.

33:36.680 --> 33:37.728
Speak.

33:38.440 --> 33:41.240
My brother is dead.

33:42.440 --> 33:44.240
It was Meng Ting Hui from the Censorate.

33:46.519 --> 33:50.559
She told me to tell you
not to hide like a turtle.

33:50.559 --> 33:53.039
She said that as long as she is
in the Censorate,

33:53.039 --> 33:55.960
the Huxiao Gang will have no peace.

34:07.200 --> 34:09.800
I detest brainless trash the most.

34:14.440 --> 34:16.760
Lv Er is dead. You can go keep him company.

34:16.760 --> 34:17.760
No--

34:21.760 --> 34:26.000
I warned Lv Er long ago
not to cause trouble during this period.

34:26.000 --> 34:28.400
My brother messed up the last job.

34:28.400 --> 34:31.239
He was too eager to make up for it,
and it got him killed.

34:31.239 --> 34:32.639
I will take a few brothers right now

34:32.639 --> 34:35.480
and bring you that wretch's head before dawn.

34:36.159 --> 34:37.480
Do you want to get killed too?

34:44.440 --> 34:47.800
Master, my brother followed you
for so many years

34:47.800 --> 34:51.639
through thick and thin.
He may have failed, but he never wavered.

34:51.639 --> 34:53.480
If we let Meng Ting Hui go,

34:54.280 --> 34:57.079
he will not find peace after death.

35:08.000 --> 35:12.840
Meng Ting Hui dared to touch my man.
She will pay a hundredfold price.

35:12.840 --> 35:14.519
Thank you, Master.

35:14.519 --> 35:16.199
As long as I can avenge my brother,

35:16.960 --> 35:20.119
blades or flames,
I'd go without a second thought.

35:23.808 --> 35:26.720
[Wanxiang Pavilion]

35:28.760 --> 35:32.079
What could not be said in a letter
that you must meet in person?

35:33.679 --> 35:38.559
That newly appointed Meng Ting Hui
killed my trusted brother.

35:39.800 --> 35:42.239
I want to personally torture her to death.

35:42.239 --> 35:45.360
His Majesty established the Censorate
to investigate the Huxiao Gang.

35:45.360 --> 35:47.840
Do you still not understand
the gravity of this matter?

35:47.840 --> 35:50.719
He was just an insignificant underling.

35:50.719 --> 35:52.239
Don't stir it up.

35:52.239 --> 35:53.239
Insignificant?

35:54.079 --> 35:57.440
If I were heartless,
would you be where you are today?

36:05.920 --> 36:10.199
What exactly are you afraid of?
She's just a woman.

36:10.199 --> 36:13.800
Abandoned by His Majesty,
she's now a prisoner.

36:14.800 --> 36:18.920
If you won't handle it,
I'll go to the Ministry of Justice myself.

36:21.440 --> 36:22.496
Stop.

36:26.280 --> 36:31.239
Any slip-up in our cause,
and it will cost our entire bloodline.

36:31.239 --> 36:35.239
Even better.
Then we brothers can die together.

36:35.239 --> 36:36.880
At least we won't walk that road alone.

36:36.880 --> 36:37.984
Shut up!

36:38.599 --> 36:42.719
Brother, you are too naive.

36:42.719 --> 36:45.559
From the first day you took this position,

36:45.559 --> 36:47.599
we have been in the same boat.

36:49.760 --> 36:53.719
Now you wish to withdraw? It's too late.

36:55.599 --> 36:57.199
I can hand her over to you.

36:57.960 --> 37:01.599
But you must act decisively
and make sure she's dead.

37:02.280 --> 37:04.679
Then I'll await good news from you, brother.

37:09.248 --> 37:13.880
[Censorate]

37:13.880 --> 37:14.912
Miss Yan.

37:21.880 --> 37:24.519
Mr. Shen, I came to look for Miss Shen.

37:24.519 --> 37:25.800
Meeting you is even better.

37:25.800 --> 37:27.119
You are close to His Majesty.

37:27.119 --> 37:29.480
Can you put in a word and have Meng released?

37:29.480 --> 37:31.519
I cannot help you with this matter.

37:34.932 --> 37:36.064
[Censorate]

38:01.760 --> 38:04.840
Miss Shen! Miss Shen!

38:04.840 --> 38:06.280
Save your breath.

38:06.280 --> 38:08.800
I came today to take Zhi Li back home

38:09.599 --> 38:10.960
so she stays out of this matter.

38:13.559 --> 38:16.960
It's one thing for you to stand idle,
but why stop Miss Shen?

38:16.960 --> 38:19.599
She only killed the ones who deserved it.
What did she do wrong?

38:21.199 --> 38:24.199
Your thoughts and Meng Ting Hui's
are indeed identical.

38:24.199 --> 38:25.320
No wonder you two can be friends.

38:26.440 --> 38:29.440
You and His Majesty are the same,
cold and heartless.

38:29.440 --> 38:31.719
One moment, favoring her
and taking her into the palace.

38:31.719 --> 38:33.960
The next moment,
throwing her into prison mercilessly.

38:33.960 --> 38:35.800
Such fickleness and caprice

38:35.800 --> 38:36.800
are truly chilling.

38:36.800 --> 38:38.559
You dare say that about His Majesty?

38:38.559 --> 38:41.239
His Majesty's judgment is his own.
You have no say here.

38:42.039 --> 38:44.079
I have no say? And what about you?

38:44.079 --> 38:46.199
A spoiled playboy
relying on His Majesty's favor.

38:46.199 --> 38:47.880
What gives you the right to yell at me?

38:47.880 --> 38:49.880
Who is yelling at whom exactly?

38:49.880 --> 38:52.079
You really know how to turn the tables.

38:52.079 --> 38:55.400
It's you! You're the one yelling at me!

38:55.400 --> 38:56.480
Mr. Shen.

39:03.679 --> 39:04.960
How did you two start arguing?

39:06.239 --> 39:07.280
Who is this young lady?

39:08.280 --> 39:09.719
My name is Yan Fu Zhi.

39:09.719 --> 39:12.639
You must be Yin Qing,
whom Meng often mentions.

39:12.639 --> 39:13.679
Where is Miss Shen?

39:13.679 --> 39:14.679
Meng has been imprisoned.

39:14.679 --> 39:17.679
I wanted to ask her to plead with His Majesty
in the palace for Meng.

39:17.679 --> 39:20.280
Miss Shen prepared a list of twenty crimes
of the Huxiao Gang overnight

39:20.280 --> 39:21.519
for His Majesty to see.

39:21.519 --> 39:23.920
She also had Lord Gu submit a memorial
to plead for leniency.

39:23.920 --> 39:26.079
But His Majesty did not relent.

39:26.079 --> 39:29.840
Then I'll go myself.
I will kowtow to His Majesty and apologize.

39:29.840 --> 39:31.440
I must see Meng.

39:31.440 --> 39:34.239
Miss Yan, wait for me a moment.

39:34.239 --> 39:35.456
Alright.

39:37.920 --> 39:40.159
Do you think His Majesty cares
about your kowtows and apology?

39:40.159 --> 39:42.119
He cares about you.
Why don't you kowtow and apologize?

39:42.119 --> 39:43.480
Why should I kowtow and apologize?

39:43.480 --> 39:44.920
What does this have to do with me?

39:44.920 --> 39:46.039
- You--
- Stop arguing, you two!

39:48.920 --> 39:51.599
The most important thing now
is to get Miss Meng out.

39:51.599 --> 39:54.000
The one who tied the bell must untie it.

39:54.000 --> 39:55.239
We want to see Miss Meng.

39:57.824 --> 39:58.944
About this matter...

39:59.760 --> 40:02.960
Mr. Shen, Meng is now locked up
in the Ministry of Justice's prison.

40:04.000 --> 40:05.639
I'm afraid
they will use unauthorized torture.

40:06.480 --> 40:08.639
I beg you, please help me.

40:09.320 --> 40:10.639
Let me go and see her.

40:10.639 --> 40:13.800
His Majesty has decreed
that no one is allowed to visit.

40:16.760 --> 40:18.800
Meng, you poor thing.

40:20.800 --> 40:25.079
You served the court,
yet you ended up being imprisoned.

40:25.079 --> 40:27.559
You go hungry and cold,

40:27.559 --> 40:28.800
and you'll be tortured.

40:30.639 --> 40:32.280
And no one is helping you.

40:33.199 --> 40:35.039
- Alright.
- What should I do?

40:35.039 --> 40:36.128
Alright.

40:37.312 --> 40:39.648
Stop crying. I'll arrange it.

40:39.648 --> 40:40.719
Really?
